  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Standard guitar string tuning includes:\n\n- A) E-A-D-G-B-E\n- B) G-D-A-E only\n- C) C-F-A-D\n- D) D-A-D-A\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Guitar is a fretted chordophone.\n\n**Answer:** True\n\n### Q3. DADGAD is:\n\n- A) An alternate tuning used in Celtic guitar\n- B) A type of drum\n- C) A piano pedal\n- D) A vocal technique\n\n**Answer:** A",
